<!-- FAQ Accordion -->
<section class="section-pad section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <span class="section-tag">Common Questions</span>
            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p>Everything you need to know before getting started with Mohaa Finest Curtains.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-accordion" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;">
            <div class="faq-accord-item">
                <div class="faq-accord-q">
                    <h4>Is the measurement service really free?</h4>
                    <span class="faq-accord-icon">+</span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-accord-a">Yes! Our measurement service is completely free with no obligation to buy. We visit your home or office, take precise measurements, and provide a quote. You only pay if you decide to proceed with the curtains.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-accord-item">
                <div class="faq-accord-q">
                    <h4>How long does installation take?</h4>
                    <span class="faq-accord-icon">+</span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-accord-a">Most residential installations are completed in 2–4 hours. Larger commercial projects may take a full day or more depending on the number of windows. We always give you an accurate timeline upfront.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-accord-item">
                <div class="faq-accord-q">
                    <h4>Do you serve areas outside Nairobi?</h4>
                    <span class="faq-accord-icon">+</span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-accord-a">Yes, we serve customers across Kenya. While our team is based in Eastleigh, Nairobi, we arrange deliveries and installations nationwide. Contact us via WhatsApp to confirm availability in your area.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-accord-item">
                <div class="faq-accord-q">
                    <h4>What types of curtains do you offer?</h4>
                    <span class="faq-accord-icon">+</span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-accord-a">We offer sheer, blackout, thermal, decorative, custom, and commercial-grade curtains in a wide range of fabrics, colours, and styles. From eyelet and pencil pleat to goblet and tab-top — we have them all.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-accord-item">
                <div class="faq-accord-q">
                    <h4>Can you make curtains for non-standard window sizes?</h4>
                    <span class="faq-accord-icon">+</span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-accord-a">Absolutely! All our curtains are cut and prepared to your exact specifications. Whether your windows are unusually tall, wide, or oddly shaped — we create a perfect fit every time.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-accord-item">
                <div class="faq-accord-q">
                    <h4>What is your after-sales guarantee?</h4>
                    <span class="faq-accord-icon">+</span>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-accord-a">We offer a 30-day satisfaction guarantee on all installations. If anything needs adjustment or doesn't meet your expectations, contact us and we'll return to fix it — at no extra charge.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

